    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obulamu obwomuRoho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano khubeenabo abali muKristo Yesu shibuliho obufwilwi bweshiina tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila lilako liaRoho wobulamu obuli muKristo Yesu liayamboholoole okhurula mwilako liobwonooni nende eliokhufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba akeenako akakhaya amalako okhukhola, shichila kali amateshele khulwa imela yomubili, Nyasaye yakakhola; mbu olwa yaruma omwanawe mukhufwana khweimela yomubili omwonooni khandi khulwa obwonooni, yakhalachila obwonooni eshiina mumela yomubili; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu mana akeenywa mumalako koosilibwe mwifwe, abarachenda mumela yomubili ta, habula mumela yaroho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila abo abali mumela yomubili bachoominjia amapaaro khukomubili; nabo abali mumela yaroho bachoominjia amapaaro khukaroho ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba eshia omubili kuchoominjiakhwo amapaaro nokhufwa; ne eshia roho yichoominjiakhwo amapaaro nobulamu nende omulembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila okhuchooma khwomubili nobusuku khuNyasaye; okhuba shikhufuchiililanga okhurukwa namalako kaNyasaye, kata okhunyala shikhwakhanyala tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abo abali mumela yomubili shibanyala okhuchamisia Nyasaye ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa inywe shimuli mumela yomubili ta, habula muli mumela yaroho, Roho waNyasaye naba namenyanga mwinywe. Ne omundu yesi ouralikhwo nende Roho waKristo ta, oyo shialikhwo owuwe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Kristo naba nali mwinywe, kho imela yomubili yiba ifu khulwa obwonooni; ne imela yaroho neinamu khulwa obulunjishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Roho wa oyo owalamusia Yesu mukhufwa naba namenya mwinywe, ye owamulamusia Kristo Yesu mukhufwa alaheelesia emibili chieenywe chioburulanda chiosi obulamu khulwa Rohowe oumenyanga mwinywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho, baana beefwe, ifwe khuli abeekobi, ne shikhuli abeekobi khumela yomubili, okhulonda ebiima biomubili, tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba nimuba nimulonda ebiima biomubili, okhuula mufwe; ne nimuba nimwira ebikhole biomubili khulwa roho, mulaba nobulamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba bosi abeemililwa nende Roho waNyasaye, abo nibo abaana baNyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila shimwaheebwa roho yobubohe obumukalusia muburii ta, ne mwaheebwa roho yokhukholwa abaana, eyichilanga nikhulanjisia khuri Aba, Papa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Roho omwene arumbulana akobuloli halala nende roho yeefwe shinga olwa khuli abaana baNyasaye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne nikhuba nikhuli abaana, kho khuli abobulaame; mbu abobulaame baNyasaye, abalaamilwa halala nende Kristo; nikhuba nikhusaalila ninaye halala, khulaheebwa oluyali halala ninaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila embasia obusaalili obwomundaalo tsino mbu shibukwanile kata okhuchelasibwa nende oluyali olwitsa okhukhufwimbulilwa ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba obulongwi bwosi bunaayanga muno nibulindiilila obufwimbulwi bwabaana baNyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila ebilonje biosi bieesibwa nibiinjisibwa mukhufuba; ne shikhwali okhwenya khwabio ta, habula khwa oyo owabiisia, nanaayanga ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu ebilonje biene nabio bilahonibwa mumbohe yobwonooneshi, nibiinjisibwa mubulekhuule bwoluyali bwabaana baNyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila khumanyile shinga ebilonje biosi halala olwa bishenyanga nibinyakhana mubusaalili okhuula bulaano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne shikali ako konyene ta, habula ifwe neefu abali nende omurongolel kwaRoho, kata ifwe abeene khushenyanga mumioyo chieefwe, nikhulindiilila okhukholwa abaana, nikhwo obununulwi bwemibili chieefwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba khwahonibwa khulwa obunaayi; ne eshinaaywa nishimalile okhulolekha shishili eshinaayungwa khandi ta; shichila ali heena ounaayanga shieneshio eshia alolanga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nikhuba nikhunaaya akeenako aka khuralola ta, kho khukalindiilila nikhwisimilisiye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho kario khandi Roho ahabinanga obuteshele bweefwe; okhuba shikhumanyile okhusaaya shinga olwa kakhukhoyeele ta; ne Roho omwene akhusaayilanga nende obushenyi oburasunjikha ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne oyo ourunilisinjia akomumioyo wamanya aka Roho yeenya, okhuba asaayilanga abatakatifu akeenako aka Nyasaye yeenya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.8.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Khuli abahuli muno",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
